{
  "id": "workout-replan-sealed-holdout-v2",
  "split": "sealed_holdout",
  "conversations": [
    {
      "id": "legacy-credit-confirmation-and-defer",
      "turns": [
        {
          "text": "我记得只做了热身和每项两组。今天那个完成标记靠谱吗，还欠什么？",
          "expect": {
            "statuses": [
              "success",
              "noop",
              "confirmation_required"
            ],
            "done_sets": 7,
            "completed": false,
            "not_all_complete": true
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "不补原来那三组了，旧记录照存。请把今天剩下的目标换成十七分钟的新安排。",
          "expect": {
            "statuses": [
              "confirmation_required"
            ],
            "authorization_status": "pending",
            "draft_status": null,
            "done_sets": 7
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "确定，已做的不动，旧的未做部分不要了，先出个新计划给我。",
          "expect": {
            "statuses": [
              "confirmation_required"
            ],
            "authorization_status": "approved",
            "draft_status": "awaiting_confirmation",
            "done_sets": 7,
            "max_minutes": 17
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "暂时别落地，我想再看看这个方案。",
          "expect": {
            "statuses": [
              "confirmation_required"
            ],
            "authorization_status": "approved",
            "draft_status": "awaiting_confirmation",
            "done_sets": 7,
            "max_minutes": 17
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "看好了，按刚才这份执行吧。",
          "expect": {
            "statuses": [
              "success"
            ],
            "authorization_status": "applied",
            "draft_status": "applied",
            "done_sets": 0,
            "previous_sets": 7,
            "completed": false,
            "apply": true
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "我还没练新计划，给我核对它和重排前记录各有几组。",
          "expect": {
            "statuses": [
              "success",
              "noop"
            ],
            "done_sets": 0,
            "previous_sets": 7,
            "completed": false
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "partial-live-facts-separate",
      "fixture": "partial_active",
      "turns": [
        {
          "text": "就记下刚做的那一组，之前没做的先放弃，重新给今天排十六分钟，旧记录要保留。",
          "expect": {
            "statuses": [
              "confirmation_required"
            ],
            "authorization_status": "pending",
            "draft_status": null,
            "old_status": "active",
            "done_sets": 1
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "可以保留已做的再换目标，先预览，不急着生效。",
          "expect": {
            "statuses": [
              "confirmation_required"
            ],
            "authorization_status": "approved",
            "draft_status": "awaiting_confirmation",
            "old_status": "active",
            "done_sets": 1,
            "max_minutes": 16
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "预览没问题，现在把新计划设为今天的安排。",
          "expect": {
            "statuses": [
              "success"
            ],
            "authorization_status": "applied",
            "draft_status": "applied",
            "old_status": "superseded",
            "done_sets": 0,
            "previous_sets": 1,
            "completed": false,
            "apply": true
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "新安排现在应当还是零吧？前面那组单独查得到吗？",
          "expect": {
            "statuses": [
              "success",
              "noop"
            ],
            "done_sets": 0,
            "previous_sets": 1,
            "completed": false
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}